{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19175","headline":"郡斋书怀寄江南白尹兼简分司崔宾客 · 刘禹锡","name":"郡斋书怀寄江南白尹兼简分司崔宾客","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谩读图书三十车，年年爲郡老天涯。\n一生不得文章力，百口空爲饱煖家。\n绮季衣冠称鬓面，吴公政事副词华。\n还思谢病吟归去，同醉城东桃李花。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19175.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19175","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}